OL,3,GNEWSAEx-prison officer sentenced over
OL,4,Apublic indecency
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former prison officer has been
OL,7,Fsentenced after being found guilty of
OL,8,Fpublic indecency and admitting firearm
OL,9,Foffences.
OL,11,FWayne David Le Cocq, 64, of Collings
OL,12,FRoad, Guernsey, admitted a charge of
OL,13,Fpossessing an unlicensed firearm and
OL,14,Fone of unsecured shotgun ammunition and
OL,15,Fwas found guilty of five acts of
OL,16,Fbehaving in an indecent manner in the
OL,17,FMagistrate's Court.
OL,19,FJudge Marc Davies sentenced him to 14
OL,20,Fweeks in prison, suspended for 12
OL,21,Fmonths.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
